  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E-mobility and sustainable energy solutions for climate action in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEF OFP in the Ministry of Environment has requested UNIDO to develop a project scaling-up low-carbon e-mobility adoption in tourism sector. The project will support the just energy transition in Albania by strengthening quality infrastructure, enabling clean energy supply, and promoting green mobility in protected areas. It will also foster green skills development, sustainable livelihoods, and inclusive growth in line with Albania#s Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs), Biodiversity Strategy, and EU accession goals.</narrative>
  </description>
